    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/gymnastics-center/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Gymnastics Center is a modern, responsive, lightweight, and SEO-optimized theme designed specifically for gymnastics academies, acrobatics schools, fitness studios, dance institutes, yoga centers, pilates studios, martial arts training hubs, sports clubs, athletic training centers, and personal trainers looking to build a powerful online presence. Built with clean and optimized code on a Bootstrap framework, it ensures fast loading speed, smooth navigation, and flawless display on all devices. The theme’s customizable sections make it easy to highlight class schedules, trainer profiles, membership plans, training programs, bootcamps, workshops, events, and testimonials, giving visitors a clear view of your offerings. Its dynamic layout and energy-driven design reflect the spirit of athletics, flexibility, and performance. Equipped with Call-to-Action (CTA) buttons, the theme boosts engagement through sign-ups, bookings, and inquiries. It supports essential plugins like WooCommerce for selling memberships or fitness merchandise, Contact Form 7 for form submissions, The Events Calendar for managing training sessions and class timetables, Yoast SEO for improved visibility, Rank Math for advanced optimization, LifterLMS and LearnPress for online training courses, and Smash Balloon for social media integration. Additionally, it is translation-ready, mobile-friendly, schema-optimized, and cross-browser compatible, ensuring a global and user-friendly experience. Perfect for sports coaches, fitness professionals, gym instructors, aerobics trainers, and training academies, Gymnastics Center provides a feature-rich, high-performing, and visually appealing platform to promote gymnastics and fitness programs effectively."
    },
